# HINDSIGHT_API_LLM_MODEL=google/gemini-2.0-flash-001
# 官方 v1.3.0 示例：HINDSIGHT_API_LLM_VERTEXAI_PROJECT_ID；下一行为示例，不声明为默认值。参见本组上方原文说明。
# HINDSIGHT_API_LLM_VERTEXAI_PROJECT_ID=your-gcp-project-id
# 官方 v1.3.0 示例：HINDSIGHT_API_LLM_VERTEXAI_REGION；下一行为示例，不声明为默认值。参见本组上方原文说明。
# HINDSIGHT_API_LLM_VERTEXAI_REGION=us-central1
# 官方 v1.3.0 示例：HINDSIGHT_API_LLM_VERTEXAI_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_KEY；下一行为示例，不声明为默认值。参见本组上方原文说明。
# HINDSIGHT_API_LLM_VERTEXAI_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_KEY=/path/to/service-account-key.json  # Optional, uses ADC if not set

# Example: MiniMax configuration (1M context window)
# Provider: `openai`, `openai-responses`, `openai-codex`, `chatgpt`, `claude-code`, `cursor`, `antigravity`,
# `github-copilot`, `anthropic`, `gemini`, `groq`, `minimax`, `deepseek`, `zai`, `opencode-go`, `meta`, `nous`,
# `xai-oauth`, `fireworks`, `ollama`, `ollama-cloud`, `lmstudio`, `llamacpp`, `vertexai`, `bedrock`, `litellm`,
# `litellmrouter`, `volcano`, `openrouter`, `requesty`, `none`, or `package.module:ClassName` for a [custom
# provider](./extensions.md#custom-llm-provider)
# 默认（官方文档）：`openai`；下一行为上游示例值。
# HINDSIGHT_API_LLM_PROVIDER=minimax
# API key for providers that require one; unused by `github-copilot`. Optional for `anthropic` when [Workload
# Identity Federation](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/manage-claude/workload-identity-federation) is configured
# (see the Anthropic example below)
# 默认（官方文档）：-；下一行为上游示例值。
# 安全：敏感凭证占位符；请替换并保护 .env，勿提交或公开。
# HINDSIGHT_API_LLM_API_KEY=your-minimax-api-key
# Model name
# 默认（官方文档）：`gpt-5-mini`；下一行为上游示例值。
# HINDSIGHT_API_LLM_MODEL=MiniMax-M3  # or MiniMax-M2.7 for the previous generation

# Example: OpenAI Responses API (/v1/responses) — reasoning + function tools together
# Provider: `openai`, `openai-responses`, `openai-codex`, `chatgpt`, `claude-code`, `cursor`, `antigravity`,
# `github-copilot`, `anthropic`, `gemini`, `groq`, `minimax`, `deepseek`, `zai`, `opencode-go`, `meta`, `nous`,
# `xai-oauth`, `fireworks`, `ollama`, `ollama-cloud`, `lmstudio`, `llamacpp`, `vertexai`, `bedrock`, `litellm`,
# `litellmrouter`, `volcano`, `openrouter`, `requesty`, `none`, or `package.module:ClassName` for a [custom
# provider](./extensions.md#custom-llm-provider)
# 默认（官方文档）：`openai`；下一行为上游示例值。
# HINDSIGHT_API_LLM_PROVIDER=openai-responses
# API key for providers that require one; unused by `github-copilot`. Optional for `anthropic` when [Workload
# Identity Federation](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/manage-claude/workload-identity-federation) is configured
# (see the Anthropic example below)
# 默认（官方文档）：-；下一行为上游示例值。
# 安全：敏感凭证占位符；请替换并保护 .env，勿提交或公开。
# HINDSIGHT_API_LLM_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key
# Model name
# 默认（官方文档）：`gpt-5-mini`；下一行为上游示例值。
# HINDSIGHT_API_LLM_MODEL=gpt-5.6  # reasoning model (gpt-5.x / o-series); e.g. gpt-5.6-terra
# Reasoning effort for providers/models that support it (for example `none`, `low`, `medium`, `high`, `xhigh`). Set
# it and the value is sent as given, whatever your model is called — which is how you control thinking-token volume
# on a self-hosted reasoning model (vLLM, Ollama, llama.cpp, TGI), where `none` is often the only value that removes
# the thinking block. Leave it unset and no reasoning parameter is sent at all, so each model runs at its own default
# effort. Honoured by `openai` and every OpenAI-compatible provider, `openai-responses`, `chatgpt`, `openai-codex`,
# `xai`, `llamacpp`, and `litellm`/`litellmrouter` (which translate it per target provider). `claude-code` passes
# `low`, `medium`, `high`, `xhigh` or `max` to each operation's CLI (other values are ignored with a warning). The
# native `gemini`/`vertexai`, `anthropic`, `cursor` and `antigravity` providers have no reasoning-effort control and
# log a warning at startup if you set one — reach those models through `litellm` to apply it.
# 默认（官方文档）：Unset (model's own default)；下一行为上游示例值。
# HINDSIGHT_API_LLM_REASONING_EFFORT=high  # sent alongside tools, unlike chat/completions

